Cara and Ann occupy a consecutive block, and Dev must sit at least three slots from both of them while still leaving room before both Ben and Hana. That pins Cara to 3, Ann to 4, and Dev to 7. Elif then Gus fill the only two earlier slots, in that order. Ben and Hana are the only people who can take 8 and 9, and exactly one person between Finn and Ben forces Finn into 6 and Ben into 8, leaving Ivo in 5 and Hana in 9.

